Enemies and NPCs drop their armor and weapon on death.

Edit the zDropEquipmentOnDeath.d to make changes:
// Configurable Armor Drop Chance:
// 0 = 0% (disabled), 1 = 33%, 2 = 50%, 3 = 75%, 4 = 100% (default)
const int z_ArmorDropChance = 4;

